{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_018_title", "source_sha256": "28e7b4ab71d1b10ad36c2b098e0f5aac0f4db456b1634f8479ab13b04090f3c6", "ja": "ひろがる気持ち☆", "zh": "感染的情绪☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_018_synopsis", "source_sha256": "96893ac47e5acf0c8ec876f7aed23599038fc876d8781c7a071e9a2910ae733e", "ja": "定期公演が楽しみで楽しみで仕方ない海美。\nその気持ちは、歩、環、響にまで広がり、\nレッスンはとても騒がしいものとなる。\nそしてレッスン後、海美は今の気持ちが客席\nにも伝わるような公演にする、と決意する。", "zh": "海美对定期公演期待得不得了。\n她的情绪同时感染了步、环、响，\n让练习课程变得热闹无比。\n练习结束后，海美决定将自己\n现在的情绪也带给前来观赏公演的观众。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_018_1000_p", "source_sha256": "89a56bd0885aabf0b7b7167bbf037ef438bc765391dfc653376120c11c0cd28d", "ja": "（幕がゆっくりと下りていく……。\nだが拍手は、いつまでも鳴り止まない）", "zh": "（布幕缓缓降下……\n但掌声完全没有停止的迹象。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_018_1001_p", "source_sha256": "e269c7d5812a371fd9f56f0b2c1f779f32801e9d1d5d4f4be0a37c7153eecb98", "ja": "（思った通り、海美たちは、\nいいステージを作ってくれたな……！）", "zh": "（海美她们果然不出我所料，\n完成了精彩的表演……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_018_1003_029umi", "source_sha256": "616b6ab362257b30f45cfa0d77d1be6337d3bee6b20f17b091a2007ac8d16fe2", "ja": "見ててくれた！？\nすっごく最高の公演になっ……わわっ！", "zh": "你有看到吗！？\n这场公演真是棒透……哇哇！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_018_1004_p", "source_sha256": "33475df827d0a589b1139426cfaaf6461163aabd31b7d19388add31548a7d3a2", "ja": "海美！？", "zh": "海美！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_018_1005_029umi", "source_sha256": "d093b6a8a8fa9fc18cc298db728b454a9fb3b62656ef6d6a5683ba0bea429e60", "ja": "あはは、転ぶところだったね、失敗失敗！\n勢いつきすぎて、足がもつれちゃったっ。", "zh": "啊哈哈，差点就跌倒了呢，真是不小心！\n冲太快，绊到脚了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_018_1006_029umi", "source_sha256": "db09172b149f8b069ad3a427ad8f58a1524b55d40861b01685cd52b8a99bbd5b", "ja": "……って、あれ？　ヒザ、ガクガクしてる。\nまだスタミナ残ってるハズなのに、なんで？", "zh": "……咦？奇怪？膝盖抖个不停。\n我明明就还有体力，怎么会这样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_018_1007_p", "source_sha256": "c59fc849f606f0539ac31341bad42d012b62258c42af98293901a6d0b3c71ce1", "ja": "一気に緊張が解けて、力が抜けちゃったのかもな。", "zh": "应该是因为一下子就解除了紧张状态，所以没力了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_018_1008_029umi", "source_sha256": "a905ff3c505188a28d71670d454e72912227662429e26a86b043a18d6993fa66", "ja": "緊張？　誰が緊張してたの？", "zh": "紧张？你说谁紧张呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_018_1009_p", "source_sha256": "883919c93148b9c9db0534e8b38c109dc5bbca07d1c56f07afce65f190d93965", "ja": "そりゃまぁ、海美だと思うけど。", "zh": "当然是在说海美呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_018_1010_029umi", "source_sha256": "fe90b3504fa40211e44f39f2294268eb0c70b1d439f5ca1b2506351cb01c7aa0", "ja": "えっ！　私、緊張してたんだっ！？　……そっか。\nそう言われると、そんな気もしてきた！", "zh": "咦！原来我有紧张啊！？\n……对耶，听你这么一说，我好像真的在紧张！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_018_1011_p", "source_sha256": "dbfcca088986c9436c7653d1c6cd69fc8da5480d9f5f8aba7182f2a7a33d8436", "ja": "気づいてなかったのか……。\nまあ、それだけ集中してたってことかもな。", "zh": "原来你都没有自觉啊……\n也好，这或许就代表你有多么专注吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_018_1012_p", "source_sha256": "1c94f3e881a2172c8014dffb5977af0511d7e871c7f8477aafa6aa4398cb95fc", "ja": "それで、どうだった、海美？\nお客さんにも、気持ちをうつせたか？", "zh": "那么，海美，结果如何？\n你有把自己的情绪带给观众吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_018_1013_029umi", "source_sha256": "00a6aee6c74934cd493116176ebf9c20f5b04569786b712e9d48304367382b66", "ja": "うんっ！　みんなニコニコだったでしょ！？\nすっ……ごく、楽しかった！", "zh": "嗯！大家不是都笑嘻嘻的吗！？\n真的……好开心喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_018_1014_029umi", "source_sha256": "00e3e6ac1178d68ec23f1be35a6a228cd6cd706693d3d85fe4083fad34b52b91", "ja": "そうだ、今からもう1曲、歌ってきていい？\nそしたらみんな、もっと喜ぶかもっ！", "zh": "对了，我可以再上去唱一首吗？\n我想大家一定会更开心的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_018_1015_p", "source_sha256": "f84fb00aa0f4717763325c53916e162092fb4a8d830b9668e36094950da98f55", "ja": "い、いや、それは次にとっておこう。\nもう帰り始めてるお客さんもいるし……！", "zh": "不、不行，留着下次吧。\n毕竟也有客人开始离席了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_018_1016_034ayu", "source_sha256": "daaeeaed57b655919de4542f486795a1c36f35d2c532a4906d6ea0675b299078", "ja": "お～い、海美～！", "zh": "喂～海美～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_018_1017_029umi", "source_sha256": "a3fd812807bbb3e1eb69dc34abeaa3e20ebf3cb3b6b54ad1e299c60c47a0374e", "ja": "あ、歩たちだ！　ねえねえ{$P$}、\nさっき私がガクってなったの、みんなにはナイショね？", "zh": "啊，是步她们！欸欸，{$P$}，\n刚才我差点摔跤的事，你可要保密喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_018_1018_029umi", "source_sha256": "e8c6a31d75e4ac7f8e9075ed0a24269f92dd5747ca541ae2a5d95be990981615", "ja": "カッコ悪いって、笑われちゃうから！", "zh": "不然会被笑说逊毙了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_018_1019_p", "source_sha256": "690691488aaef8d0f5740fd857a10822846b6fdbec9a0defa21ab7aab5cad340", "ja": "はは、わかったよ。", "zh": "哈哈，我知道了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_018_1020_034ayu", "source_sha256": "99066c31f1a5492ee0e77e69e9bdf081c6c1efa40407a9d4a7f3843b81a454b4", "ja": "海美、グッジョブ！　大盛り上がりだったよね！\nあっ！　何なら今からもう1回、歌いに戻ろっか？", "zh": "海美，Good Job！气氛嗨到最高点了呢！\n啊！要不干脆再回去唱一首歌？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_018_1021_040tam", "source_sha256": "5453fb666b920b41621aee9a91844a74ef33e3de7c4b3f935e3bab706bfe26b8", "ja": "それならたまきもいっしょに出るぞ！\n急いであせ、ふいてくる！", "zh": "这样环也要一起去！\n环擦个汗马上就好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_018_1022_p", "source_sha256": "1b0d5940843c0ea614c2d6a93c21196400037c4a32d94a36e104fdcc4d4bc11d", "ja": "……お前たちは、基本的に考えることが同じなのか？\n響、お前からなんとか言ってくれ！", "zh": "……难道你们的基本思路都是一样的吗？\n响，你帮我念念她们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_018_1023_013hib", "source_sha256": "54029abd18c89c6d95f34f5d4ddf7f0a21348733263a3bb5fe898b0a4e7679bf", "ja": "わかったぞ！　……あのね、みんな。いくら楽しく\nても、体力を全部使い切るのは、ダメなんだ。", "zh": "好喔！……大家听好啰，就算表演得再开心，\n也不能把体力通通耗尽。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_018_1024_013hib", "source_sha256": "a65e984aa88c95ca2eefb7e211c9b5b40f145d5683722a1183bc382e5d45dc37", "ja": "次の日の仕事に影響が出たら、大変だからね！", "zh": "要是影响到隔天的工作就糟了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_018_1025_p", "source_sha256": "7053498fd101925a29b082ad1e4ab01e410924833ea8ff4535701891cbeba18f", "ja": "（響……さすがだ……！）", "zh": "（响……你真棒……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_018_1026_013hib", "source_sha256": "4aeb02cc74da095061e49f5d5ebf2843fb2b2846edf708d9984a959bcfac4c88", "ja": "……って{$P$}がウルサイから、\n戻るときは言わないほうがいいぞっ。", "zh": "……因为{$P$}会碎碎念，\n所以想回舞台的话最好不要跟他说喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_018_1027_p", "source_sha256": "ec236085eb8466c35f74561247b8e8631357f1b0d626c083fc12524f5467b46f", "ja": "（響……お前もか……！）", "zh": "（响……你也是同伙吗……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_018_1028_029umi", "source_sha256": "a1a41019c11b4877845e1eaa988c6e7e9d162c3fa9b6cd6d377441655570e607", "ja": "じゃあ、今日はもうバレちゃったからダメだね。\nでも私、またみんなと踊りたい！　このステージで！", "zh": "像今天已经被发现就没办法了。\n不过，我还想在这个舞台上！跟大家一起跳舞！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_018_1029_034ayu", "source_sha256": "271d0bd084764035157af95914dcd2accbdef870ee2bb369ff3d4cb13f49f424", "ja": "賛成！　息ピッタリだったもんね、アタシ達。\nあっ。でも、次はアタシがセンターだからな！", "zh": "我赞成！我们刚才真的是默契十足呢。\n啊，不过，下次换我当Center啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_018_1030_040tam", "source_sha256": "d9d365ed4e2503280762db8142f9c914ddc49444bab1c2ddab9fc374b9472feb", "ja": "ずるいぞ～！　たまきも、センターやるっ！\nおやぶん、たまきは、いつ？　いつ順番？", "zh": "不公平啦～！环也要当Center！\n老大，环什么时候可以当？什么时候轮到环？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_018_1031_013hib", "source_sha256": "32902b637638407e85bbf23ef34fe3f89afc70321f98bd65db84f24b2e1fbf88", "ja": "ふふーん。そろそろ自分の出番だよね？\nだって自分、いつでもカンペキだし！", "zh": "哼哼～应该要换本人了吧？\n谁叫本人无时无刻不是完美的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_018_1032_029umi", "source_sha256": "47d827b1d7290d7ee62d287642302dbeb6e4b22eecfa3fd024bbc83ef214ab15", "ja": "はいはい！　私、もう1回センターやりたい！\nアンコール公演って、どうかな！？", "zh": "我我我！我还想再当一次Center！\n办个安可公演怎么样！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_018_1033_034ayu", "source_sha256": "23297cc672bad92d7440d078fefdabbd406179a71003d89243158f1c8756b2de", "ja": "そ、そんなのズルいよ！？\nね、それはダメだよね、{$P$}！？", "zh": "这、这样太奸诈了啦！？\n欸，{$P$}，不能这样吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_018_1034_040tam", "source_sha256": "7beda44deeab0cf16fd0006a2c39b7c0ae6ed03e00c8c8319fb2d035a1e56b5e", "ja": "おやぶん！　おやぶーんっ！！", "zh": "老大！老大──！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_018_1035_p", "source_sha256": "a8100eea5578f4e486c84be6dbaa6ed9f893acaa55d42ddc148b144e81b08e66", "ja": "（公演が終わったばかりなのに、みんな元気だな……。\nこれも、海美の気持ちがうつったせいかもしれない）", "zh": "（公演明明才刚结束，大家还这么有活力啊……\n或许在场的人，都被海美的情绪给感染了呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_018_1036_p", "source_sha256": "3e546026fdd1495384eba923803f63ff857db02c08ef58de2c32b03f22a248f5", "ja": "（お互いに高め合って、最高のステージを作り\n上げたんだ。ひとまず……、休んでいいぞ！）", "zh": "（大家切磋琢磨，完成了最棒的表演。\n总之……先好好休息吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
